 0CD2   0026    '----- intro: black the palette, hold ~1s (hides the slow carr.
                pic BLOAD on old hardware), then load + reveal the car scene
 0CD2   0026    SUB introShowCarr
 0CDD   0026            DIM t9 AS SINGLE, d9 AS SINGLE
 0CDD   0026            PALETTE 1, 0: PALETTE 2, 0: PALETTE 3, 0
 0CDD   0026            t9 = TIMER
